ld-3}}\n$=0}$" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294278 1113 #uuid "926edf84-42b1-556a-b7aa-63fc4baac279" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294278 1145 "The given set contains the roots $z\\in C$ of some cubic polynomial $p(z).$\n\nSince the cubic polynomial has roots ${z}_{1}=2,$ ${z}_{2}=3-\\text{i},$ and ${z}_{3}=3+\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(z) & =a(z-{z}_{1})(z-{z}_{2})(z-{z}_{3}) \\\\  & =(1)(z-2)(z-(3-\\text{i}))(z-(3+\\text{i})) \\\\  & =(z-2)({z}^{2}-z(3+\\text{i})-z(3-\\text{i})+(3-\\text{i})(3+\\text{i})) \\\\  & =(z-2)({z}^{2}-6z+10) \\\\  & ={z}^{3}-6{z}^{2}+10z-2{z}^{2}+12z-20 \\\\  & ={z}^{3}-8{z}^{2}+22z-20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the given set as\n\n$$\n{2,3-\\text{i},3+\\text{i}}={z\\in C\\,:\\,{z}^{3}-8{z}^{2}+22z-20=0}.\n$$" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294279 1000 #edb/ref 17592186294280 13194139534549 true] [17592186294279 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534549 true] [17592186294279 1041 "field-1" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294279 1104 #edb/ref 17592186294280 13194139534549 true] [17592186294279 1110 #uuid "6dc9ed36-2e28-53d3-b481-63ba06aab151" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294280 1034 "8" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294280 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534549 true] [17592186294280 1111 #uuid "91dcc00f-f2c8-5426-abf6-ea1bd962502f" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294281 1000 #edb/ref 17592186294282 13194139534549 true] [17592186294281 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534549 true] [17592186294281 1041 "field-2" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294281 1104 #edb/ref 17592186294282 13194139534549 true] [17592186294281 1110 #uuid "2197653f-5856-51b3-ae3c-3a6c052c22e4" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294282 1034 "22" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294282 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534549 true] [17592186294282 1111 #uuid "c7b45060-96c6-56b3-8a7a-8c9256323089" 13194139534549 true] [17592186294283 1000 #edb/ref 175921862